  "label": "Desensitization to Trauma",
  "description": "This refers to the psychological process of becoming less emotionally affected by traumatic events through repeated exposure or by using them as metaphors. The meme risks desensitizing viewers to the horror of the Holocaust by normalizing its imagery in a motivational context, potentially reducing the emotional and moral weight of historical atrocity.",
